lift-am-beta (G : GA) (A : GA) (B : GA) (b : GA) (a : GA) (rA : LiftTy[G,A]) (rB : LiftTy[(aext G A),B]) (r1 : LiftTm[(aext G A),b,B]) (r2 : LiftTm[G,a,A]) : LiftME[G,(aapp A B (alam A B b) a),(asb b (asec A a)),(asb B (asec A a))] =
