lift-aq-sec-comp (D : GA) (G : GA) (A : GA) (a : GA) (s : GA) (r1 : LiftTy[G,A]) (r2 : LiftTm[G,a,A]) (r3 : LiftSub[D,s,G]) : LiftSE[D,(acomp (asec A a) s),(acomp (alift A s) (asec (asb A s) (asb a s))),(aext G A)] =
