lift-am-q-cx (G : GA) (H : GA) (A : GA) (B : GA) (re : LiftCE[G,H]) (rp : LiftTE[G,A,B]) : LiftME[(aext G A),(aq G A),(aq H B),(asb A (ap G A))] =
  put-me (aext G A) (aq G A) (aq H B) (asb A (ap G A)) (e-ext G re.c.e A rp.a) (e-q G re.c.e A rp.a) (e-q H re.k.e B rp.b) (e-tsb (fext re.c.e.t rp.a.t) re.c.e.t A rp.a (ap G A) (e-p G re.c.e A rp.a)) (fm-q-cx re.c.e.t re.k.e.t rp.a.t rp.b.t pe pp)
 where {
    pe : CE re.c.e.t re.k.e.t = re.d ;
    pp : TE re.c.e.t rp.a.t rp.b.t = (at-te G A B rp re.c) ;
